# eve fmt --check reports a file whose layout would change (trailing white space, blank lines in a row, more than one line ending at the end) and exits 1; a file in layout exits 0 (lexical.md#layout)
** spec: semantics/tools.md#eve-fmt
primary aspect d46_fmt_command is
  process main is
    print "fmt";
  return;
end d46_fmt_command;
/*@expect
{
  "command": ["fmt", "--check", "messy.eve"],
  "exit": 1,
  "contains": ["messy.eve: not formatted", "fmt: 1 file(s), 1 not formatted"]
}
*/
